+Why the sheets are split this way: a player only ever sees one device's prompts, so keyboard, Xbox, PlayStation, and touch are kept apart and only one set loads. The 12 HUD icons always appear together, so they share one sheet. Item portraits are shown one at a time, come from a large set that grows every update, and are drawn one at a time, so each is its own image. 9-slice frames and tiles have to be separate images, because `Slice` and `Tile` work on the whole image.
