+## B11. Glow: `Glow.png`
+
+A 120 px circle with a 30 px layer blur. Roblox can't blur a single layer, so it is baked.
+
+- To export: make a **180 x 180** frame (no fill) centred on the ellipse (at x 1730, y 470). Inside it, put the ellipse at (30, 30), set to white at **100%**, keeping the 30 px layer blur. Export at 2x → **360 x 360**. The outer pixels must be fully transparent; if the blur reaches the edge, enlarge the frame and tell us the new size.
+
+ImageLabel: `Size = 180 x 180` (the visible circle is the middle 120), `BackgroundTransparency = 1`, `Image = Glow`, `ScaleType = Fit`, `ImageColor3 = 255, 200, 60`, `ImageTransparency = 0.4`.
