+## Native visuals (nothing to export)
+
+### Keyboard prompts (`40:129`): B, I, E, Q, 1, 2, 3, Esc, Tab, Shift
+
+Each key is a plain rounded box with a stroke and a text label, which Roblox draws directly. Keeping it native means a rebound key or a new key costs nothing.
+
+- Frame: `BackgroundColor3 = 235, 237, 242`, height 40, width 40 for one character and 56 for Esc / Tab / Shift (or automatic width with a minimum of 40).
+- `UICorner`: radius 6.
+- `UIStroke`: `Thickness = 2`, `Color = 153, 157, 171`, `BorderStrokePosition = Inner`.
+- TextLabel: Builder Sans Bold (700), 18 px, line height 24, `TextColor3 = 31, 33, 41`, centred.
+
+### Profile Card (`40:153`)
+
+- Frame 360 x 190, `BackgroundColor3 = 33, 37, 54`, `UICorner` 16.
+- Avatar (`40:151`): the Figma photo is a placeholder (designer note). It is an ImageLabel 150 x 150 at (20, 20) with `Image = rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id=<UserId>&w=352&h=352`. 352 is the next thumbnail size above 300 px, which is what 150 becomes at 2x. `UICorner` `CornerRadius = UDim.new(0.5, 0)` makes it a circle. **Do not export the placeholder.**
+
+### Glass Card (`40:155`)
+
+- Frame 320 x 200, `UICorner` 16.
+- `UIStroke`: `Thickness = 1`, white, `Transparency = 0.8`, `BorderStrokePosition = Inner`.
+- Title (`40:154`): TextLabel, Builder Sans Bold (700), 22 px, line height 28, white.
+- **Gap:** the design uses a 20 px background blur over a 10% white fill. Roblox can't blur what is behind a single frame (`BlurEffect` blurs the whole 3D view). We will use a darker, more opaque fill instead, starting with `BackgroundColor3 = 33, 37, 54` and `BackgroundTransparency = 0.15`. **The designer should review this.**
+
+### Progress Bar (`40:158`)
+
+- Track: Frame 300 x 12, white, `BackgroundTransparency = 0.88`, `UICorner` 6.
+- Fill (`40:156`): Frame with `BackgroundColor3 = 87, 209, 118`, `UICorner` 6, `Size = UDim2.new(progress, 0, 1, 0)` (the designer note says its width follows quest progress). Below 12 px wide the rounded ends distort, so hide the fill at 0 progress or give it a minimum width of 12.
