+## Checks after upload
+
+- Every image loads in game (`ImageLabel.IsLoaded`) and looks sharp at UI scale 2 (a 4K window or the device emulator).
+- Every sprite rect lands on its piece. Also check the sheets on a real phone: some phones and consoles have been reported to draw rects on the wrong piece.
+- With a UI scale above 1, the dot grid still spaces its dots one tile apart (24 px x scale). If the spacing stays at 24 physical px, `TileSize` has to be multiplied by the scale.
+- There are no dark fringes on soft edges (logo glow, Glow, badge, item portraits). Fringes mean alpha bleed was skipped.
+- The logo halves meet without a seam at 1.33x.
